From: RenkuOS GPU Development <gpu-development@localhost>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:26:22 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] intel_extreme: add rollback-aware Dekel PLL programmer

---
 .../intel_extreme/DekelHdmiPllProgrammer.h    | 171 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 171 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/add-ons/accelerants/intel_extreme/DekelHdmiPllProgrammer.h

diff --git a/src/add-ons/accelerants/intel_extreme/DekelHdmiPllProgrammer.h b/src/add-ons/accelerants/intel_extreme/DekelHdmiPllProgrammer.h
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..c80a61eb
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/add-ons/accelerants/intel_extreme/DekelHdmiPllProgrammer.h
@@ -0,0 +1,171 @@
